{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape the Beach</strong>  is a walking simulator that you play from a first-person perspective. You can expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">beautiful, traversable beach environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">full day-night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">short story mode (can be completed in under an hour)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">narrator that guides you through the experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">multiple objects that appear on the beach, which could potentially aid in your escape (or perhaps the key lies somewhere else entirely)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Consider wishlisting the game if you find the concept interesting!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/beach_trailer_gif2.gif?t=1748022308\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You find yourself on a quiet tropical beach. Before you is the vast ocean, behind you\u2014a lush forest. Guiding you under the scorching sun is a soothing but ominous voice, whose intentions you're not quite sure of yet. Is it going to help you leave the beach, or force you to wander endlessly along a serene landscape of water and sand?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/beach_trailer_gif_1.gif?t=1748022308\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the secrets of the beach and bask in its beauty, inquire about the out-of-place objects you find on it, listen to the sarcastic remarks of the voice and try to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/beach_trailer_gif3.gif?t=1748022308\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Escape the Beach</strong> is a short, 