esting!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/beach_trailer_gif2.gif?t=1748022308\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You find yourself on a quiet tropical beach. Before you is the vast ocean, behind you\u2014a lush forest. Guiding you under the scorching sun is a soothing but ominous voice, whose intentions you're not quite sure of yet. Is it going to help you leave the beach, or force you to wander endlessly along a serene landscape of water and sand?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/beach_trailer_gif_1.gif?t=1748022308\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the secrets of the beach and bask in its beauty, inquire about the out-of-place objects you find on it, listen to the sarcastic remarks of the voice and try to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/beach_trailer_gif3.gif?t=1748022308\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Escape the Beach</strong> is a short, immersive narrative experience where your one and only objective is clear: you have to escape the beach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["antonitium"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/f8ad80297e17159a54722711f96f196d97dd2f33/header.jpg?t=1748022308","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recomm